<title>UK: P&amp;U say 1997 results could be flat-analysts.</title>
<headline>P&amp;U say 1997 results could be flat-analysts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn Inc said on Tuesday that its 1997 results could be roughly in line with 1996, analysts said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>One analyst told Reuters that the company made the statement during a conference call.</p>
<p>Earlier the company confirmed last week's profit warning, reporting sales down six percent and earnings per share down nearly 16 percent in the first three months of the year.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
